THIRD-PARTY MODEL WEIGHTS
================================================================================

Ocelotl's source code contains no model weights. It loads them at runtime from
files the user supplies. The licences below therefore attach to the *weights*,
not to this source tree — but they do attach to any distribution, container
image, or release artifact that bundles them, and to the fixtures and reference
tensors derived from them.

The distinction that matters: several of these are NOT permissive in the way the
code is. In particular the Parakeet weights are CC-BY-4.0, which requires
attribution and a statement of changes wherever they travel. Shipping them with
no NOTICE is a licence violation even though shipping the code is not.

