Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 — ONNX export (parity oracle)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model:      istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-onnx
Source:     https://huggingface.co/istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-onnx
Licence:    CC-BY-4.0, inherited from the NVIDIA weights above.

Used only as a numerical reference: the exported graphs are run to produce
golden tensors that Ocelotl's implementation is diffed against. The exported
graphs are not redistributed by Ocelotl and are not required at runtime.

Changes made: the graphs are re-saved locally with additional intermediate
tensors promoted to graph outputs, purely to localize parity failures. These
instrumented copies stay on the developer's machine.

TDT greedy decoding semantics follow onnx-asr (https://github.com/istupakov/onnx-asr),
MIT licensed, which ships alongside these exports. No code was copied; the loop
was reimplemented in Rust from the published algorithm.

